## 12. Frontmatter Fields Reference

Every field a `.md`/`.mdx` post can declare, what it does, and where it's
actually consumed. If a field isn't listed here, the route ignores it.

### Identity / core content
| Field | Type | Used where | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `title` | string | Metadata `<title>`, H1, all schemas | Falls back to `'Untitled'` if missing |
| `excerpt` | string | Meta description, OG/Twitter description, card previews | Falls back to a generated string if missing |
| `content` (body, not frontmatter) | markdown/MDX | Main article body | — |
| `date` | ISO string | Sort order, `datePublished` schema, display date | Falls back to `new Date().toISOString()` — **always set this**, or posts sort unpredictably |
| `dateModified` | ISO string | `dateModified` schema field | Falls back to `date` if omitted |
| `author` | string | Resolved via `resolveAuthor()` → full author object | Falls back to `'Mirellé Team'`; must match a slug/name in `src/data/authors.ts` |
| `category` | string | `/blog?category=` filtering, breadcrumb schema, `articleSection` | — |
| `tags` | string[] | `keywords` meta, `about` entity schema | — |

### Media
| Field | Type | Used where |
|---|---|---|
| `image` | string (path) | Hero image, OG image, `coverImage` fallback |
| `imageAlt` | string | Alt text, image schema `caption`/`name` |
| `imageWidth` / `imageHeight` | number | OG image dims, image schema (defaults 1200×630) |
| `imageCaption` | string | Article schema image caption (falls back to `imageAlt`) |
| `carouselImages` | `{url, alt}[]` | Mid-article `<ImageCarousel>` |

### Routing / structure
| Field | Type | Used where |
|---|---|---|
| `topic` | string | Determines `/blog/[topic]/[slug]` URL, drives `injectInspoGalleryLinks()` gallery link target |
| `topicalMap` | object | Pillar/cluster relationships — **see §2, this is critical, read that section** |
| `template` | `'center' \| 'split-left' \| 'split-right' \| 'grid'` | Picks render template in `[...slug]/page.tsx`. Defaults to `center` |
| `navigationContext` | object | Optional prev/next/pillar post links (type exists, not currently rendered anywhere in the fetched route files) |
| `canonical` | string (URL) | Overrides the auto-generated canonical URL |

### Rich content blocks
| Field | Type | Used where |
|---|---|---|
| `tldr` | `{summary[], tldrFaqs?, creativeLine?, keyTakeaways?}` | `<WrapUp>` block at top of article, feeds `speakable` schema (hardcoded to `.tldr-section`) |
| `faqItems` | `{question, answer}[]` | `<FAQ>` component + `FAQPage` schema |
| `products` | `Product[]` | `<ProductGrid>` — placed via `{{PRODUCTS:count:indices}}` tokens in body content |
| `wordCount` | number | Article schema `wordCount` (falls back to a rough split-by-space count) |
| `readTime` | string/number | Displayed under title (defaults `'5 min'`) |

### Behavior flags
| Field | Type | Default | Used where |
|---|---|---|---|
| `showInspoGalleryLink` | boolean | `true` | Set to `false` to suppress the "Explore {topic} inspiration gallery" link that otherwise auto-appears after every body image when `topic` is set. Checked in `injectInspoGalleryLinks()` (`.md`) and `MDXContent.tsx`'s `img` override (`.mdx`). **Only has any effect if `topic` is also set** — no `topic` means no link regardless of this flag. |

### Declared in types but not read anywhere in this route currently
`updatedDate`, `eventData` (type exists, `generateEventSchema` exists in
`generateSchemas.ts`, but `[...slug]/page.tsx` never passes `eventData` into
`generateSchemas()`'s config — dead wiring unless connected).

### Not yet implemented (proposed, discussed, not built)
SEO/AEO/GEO frontmatter expansion was discussed but **not added**:
`metaTitle`, `noindex` (per-post), `speakableSelectors`, `keyEntities`,
`expertReviewedBy`, `citationFacts`, `lastFactCheckedDate`, `focusKeyword`.
None of these exist in the codebase yet — do not assume they work if you see
them referenced in planning notes elsewhere.

